    "intro_narrative": "The rain lashes against the windows of the precinct. You are Detective Hayes, and you've spent the last six months tracking the 'Ghost Syndicate', a notorious crime ring that leaves no digital footprint. Tonight, you've finally infiltrated their abandoned safehouse, discovering a web of specialized forensic tools, outdated electronics, and encrypted servers. Time is running out before they realize their lair has been compromised. Your ultimate objective is to extract the master evidence drive, which contains the final proof needed to bring the entire syndicate down. To get it, you'll need to power up the station's mainframe and correctly route the fragmented data left behind in the room. Observe the connections carefully, trace the digital breadcrumbs, and piece together the truth before dawn breaks.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
